<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/msa@/~part_I__cl_20> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "20" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/msa@/~part_I__cl_20> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/msa@/~part_I__cl_20> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan seksyen 108 dengan seksyen yang berikut: “Non-deduction of tax from dividend 108. Where a dividend is paid or credited by a company to any of its shareholders in the basis period for a year of assessment, the company shall not be entitled to deduct tax from such dividend paid or credited.”. Pindaan seksyen 109"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/msa@> .
